      *> A refund of one queued service that was not started. It is made in the payment's own currency.
       FD  REFUND-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 152 CHARACTERS.
           01 REFUND-RECORD.
               05 RFD-ID PIC 9(8). *> Primary key
               05 RFD-PAY-ID PIC 9(8).
               05 RFD-QUE-ID PIC 9(8).
               05 RFD-CURRENCY PIC X(3).
               05 RFD-AMOUNT PIC 9(9)V99.
               05 RFD-BY PIC X(30). *> Customer or consultant who asked
               05 RFD-AT PIC 9(14).
               05 RFD-STATUS PIC X(10). *> REQUESTED, DONE or REFUSED
               05 RFD-REASON PIC X(60).
